# Optional: enables the /api/institutions POST/DELETE routes to sign
# authoriseInstitution/removeInstitution transactions server-side on behalf
# of the admin wallet. Leave unset to manage institutions from the admin's
# wallet directly instead (client-side signing). In production, store this key
# in a secrets manager (e.g. AWS Secrets Manager, HashiCorp Vault) or KMS with
# encrypted-at-rest storage; never commit raw keys to version control.
ADMIN_PRIVATE_KEY=
